(ac22a60a23d66c37d43a7ec6d9e99b99a4320356), the tarball and SHA-256
internal/controlplane/serviceproxy/catalog_sources.json pins. Its release files
are fetched by the machines that run agents at the version and SHA-256
internal/shared/agenttool/catalog.go pins, never redistributed.

What is taken from it here: of each method of its service catalog
(internal/registry/catalog/services/*.json) and each request its shortcut
commands send (shortcuts/<group>/*.go), the HTTP method, the path, the risk
lark-cli gives it and the scopes it checks before sending it
(internal/controlplane/serviceproxy/lark_methods.json, written by
internal/controlplane/serviceproxy/catalogsgen). Nothing else of its source is
kept. The catalog of actions made from that list is Hypomnema's own
(internal/controlplane/serviceproxy/lark.go).

